Subject: Re: Camera survey detection probability
Message-ID: <_dpkfW56CpE.jF7oNdqfSVAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <_dpkfW56CpE.tWcvN-ZXBx4J@unmarked.groups.google.com>
